# Flute notes: a high question enters first; the last phrase answers the horn. Expression: breath gaps and a softer last note.
# Violin notes: soft response becomes a brief sustained arrival; the palette blends solo/section. Expression: one upper accent, then a long taper by written dynamics.
# Viola notes: held middle thirds and inner step motion. Expression: sparse tenuto under the melody; absent during the brass reply.
# Cello notes: rooted low counterline through all sections, independent of the violin rhythm. Expression: long foundations and lighter fifths.
# Horn notes: takes the melody for two bars, then only supports the cadence. Expression: broad attacks with an empty beat for breath.
# Harp notes: broken chord replies under the flute, then silence under the horn. Expression: quiet individual plucks and a held tonic dyad.
# Timpani notes: two pitched dominant pillars lead to a single tonic, not a constant beat. Expression: quiet first hit, firmer arrival, no fake rapid-note roll.
song "Orchestral handoff" 96 4/4 C seed=206 tail=4 mood=balanced
inst fl=sampler/flute vn=sound/violin_palette(morph_x=.45, tone_brightness=-.12) va=sampler/violas vc=sampler/cello hn=sampler/horn harp=sampler/orchestral_harp timp=sampler/timpani
chords C:2 F:2 G7:2 C:2
light 2 | fl:{deg: "=p 0/4 2/8 4/8 2/4 r/4 | 0/2_ r/2", oct: 1} va:{deg: "=p 2/1_ | -3/2_ r/2"} vc:{deg: "=p 0/2_ -3/4 r/4 | 0/2_ r/2", oct: -1} harp:{deg: "=p 0/8 2/8 4/4 r/2 | r/4 2/8 4/8 7/4 r/4"}
bow 2 | vn:{deg: "=mp 3/4 5/8 4/8 3/4 r/4 | 5/2_ r/2", oct: 1} va:{deg: "=p 0/2_ 1/2 | -4/2_ r/2"} vc:{deg: "=mp 3/2_ 0/4 r/4 | 3/2_ r/2", oct: -1} harp:{deg: "=p r/2 0/8 3/8 5/4 | 3/2_ r/2"}
brass 2 | hn:{deg: "=mp 4/4_ 6/8 5/8 4/4 r/4 | 2/2_ r/2"} vc:{deg: "=mp 4/2_ 1/4 2/4 | 4/2_ r/2", oct: -1} timp:{deg: "=p 4/4 r/2 r/4 | =mp 4/4 r/2 r/4", oct: -2}
arrival 2 | fl:{deg: "=mp r/2 4/4 2/4 | =p 0/2_ r/2", oct: 1} vn:{deg: "=mf 4/2_^ 2/4 0/4 | =p 0/2_ r/2", oct: 1} vc:{deg: "=mp 0/2_ -3/4 r/4 | =p 0/2_ r/2", oct: -1} hn:{deg: "=p 2/1_ | 2/2_ r/2"} harp:{deg: "=mp [0,4]/2_ r/2 | =p [0,2]/2_ r/2"} timp:{deg: "=mp 0/4 r/2 r/4 | r/1", oct: -2}
mix fl -8 pan=-.25 hall=.15 | vn -8 pan=-.15 hall=.15 | va -10 pan=.1 hall=.14 | vc -7 pan=.25 hall=.12 | hn -8 pan=.35 hall=.15 | harp -10 pan=-.35 hall=.1 | timp -14 pan=.15 hall=.15
master standard lufs=-18 glue=none
